  "description": "This coordinated collection of 40 Rustic Christmas Watercolor Clipart illustrations.\nFeaturing traditional Christmas stockings, evergreen wreaths, gingerbread houses, plaid ornaments, decorative stars, festive gift boxes and vintage-inspired craft accessories, this collection combines classic Christmas colors with a cozy rustic aesthetic.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n– 40 Christmas-themed PNG illustrations\n– Festive Christmas stockings\n– Evergreen wreaths and botanical arrangements\n– Gingerbread houses and gingerbread characters\n– Santa Claus face illustration\n– Plaid Christmas hearts and decorative stars\n– Embroidered-style Christmas ornaments\n– Wrapped gift boxes and decorative baskets\n– Vintage brass lantern\n– Christmas tree ornaments and snowflakes\n– Ribbon spools and craft accessories\n– Rustic wooden craft organizer\n– Holiday sewing and embroidery-inspired elements\n– Traditional red-and-green Christmas decorations\n ART STYLE\nPremium watercolor and gouache-inspired illustrations featuring delicate painted washes, soft dry-brush edges, subtle paper grain, rustic textures and traditional Christmas colors.\nThe collection combines farmhouse Christmas charm, vintage holiday styling, coordinated plaid patterns and handcrafted decorative details.\n FILE DETAILS\n– Quantity: 40 illustrations\n– Format: PNG\n– Theme: Rustic Christmas crafts and holiday decorations\n– Intended use: Digital crafting and graphic design projects\nPlease review the preview and included files before purchasing. Actual image dimensions, resolution and background transparency depend on the supplied files.\nCreate beautiful, coordinated holiday designs with this Rustic Christmas Craft Watercolor Clipart Collection.",
